---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../config/site';
import { getPath } from '../utils/paths';

const breadcrumbItems = [
  { name: 'Legal & Terms', url: getPath('/terms/') },
  { name: 'Terms of Service', url: getPath('/terms/') }
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service & Financial Disclaimer"
  metaTitle="Terms of Service & YMYL Financial Disclaimer | CreatorCalcLab"
  description="Terms of service, warranty disclaimers, and strict YMYL financial notices governing the use of CreatorCalcLab interactive financial calculators."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
>
  <div class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
      <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbItems} />
      <div class="mt-4">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800">
          Last Revised: November 13, 2026
        </span>
        <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          Terms of Service & Financial Disclaimer
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Binding legal terms, warranty disclaimers, and non-fiduciary operational agreements governing access to CreatorCalcLab computational models.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-slate-900 prose-p:text-slate-700 prose-p:leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">

      <!-- Critical YMYL Notice Callout -->
      <div class="my-6 p-5 bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-600 rounded-r-lg">
        <h3 class="text-amber-950 font-bold text-base mt-0 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
          MANDATORY FINANCIAL, TAX & ACCOUNTING DISCLAIMER (YMYL)
        </h3>
        <p class="text-amber-900 text-sm mb-0">
          CREATORCALCLAB IS NOT A LICENSED CERTIFIED PUBLIC ACCOUNTING (CPA) FIRM, INVESTMENT ADVISORY SERVICE, OR LAW PRACTICE. ALL CALCULATORS, DATA MATRICES, AND EDITORIAL GUIDES ARE PROVIDED STRICTLY FOR INFORMATIONAL, EDUCATIONAL, AND SCENARIO-MODELING PURPOSES. NO PROFESSIONAL FIDUCIARY RELATIONSHIP IS CREATED BY YOUR ACCESS TO THIS SITE. NEVER EXECUTE CAPITAL ALLOCATIONS, TAX FILINGS, OR BUSINESS CONTRACTS WITHOUT DIRECT VERIFICATION FROM A QUALIFIED FINANCIAL PROFESSIONAL.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms of Service ("Terms") constitute a legally binding agreement between you ("User," "you," or "your") and CreatorCalcLab ("Company," "we," "us," or "our"). By accessing or using <a href="https://creatorcalclab.com" class="text-emerald-700 underline font-medium">https://creatorcalclab.com</a>, including any sub-pages, interactive calculators, formulas, or associated content, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these Terms and our Privacy Policy. If you do not accept these Terms in full, you are prohibited from using the website.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Informational & Educational Nature of Computational Models</h2>
      <p>
        The calculations, formulas, estimated fee deductions, margin forecasts, and mathematical projections produced by CreatorCalcLab are simplified arithmetic representations based on publicly available documentation and user-provided inputs. You explicitly acknowledge and agree that:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Estimates Only:</strong> All outputs represent theoretical estimates. Real-world financial results will deviate due to bank interchange variance, carrier dimensional weight surcharges, localized sales tax laws, foreign currency exchange fluctuation, and disputed transaction chargebacks.</li>
        <li><strong>No CPA or Financial Advice:</strong> Nothing published on CreatorCalcLab constitutes licensed accounting advice, tax preparation services, investment counsel, or business underwriting.</li>
        <li><strong>Independent Verification Required:</strong> You remain solely and exclusively responsible for confirming your platform contracts, verifying tax obligations with state and federal authorities (such as the IRS or HM Revenue & Customs), and auditing your merchant gateway statements.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Third-Party Platform Policies & Fee Schedule Volatility</h2>
      <p>
        CreatorCalcLab audits platform rate cards—including but not limited to Shopify Inc., Etsy Inc., Stripe Inc., Alphabet Inc. (YouTube), and Gumroad Inc.—against published documentation verified as of the date indicated on each calculator (e.g., November 2026). However:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Third-party platforms frequently alter their fees, subscription tiers, listing costs, and transaction penalties at their sole discretion with minimal advance warning.</li>
        <li>Specialized merchant terms, grandfathered legacy rates, high-risk merchant surcharges, and enterprise volume discounts negotiated privately with sales representatives are not reflected in our standard public baseline models.</li>
        <li>CreatorCalcLab disclaims all liability for any operational discrepancies, billing disputes, or cash-flow losses arising from changes made by third-party platforms to their fee schedules.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Permitted Use & Prohibited Conduct</h2>
      <p>
        CreatorCalcLab grants you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to access and use our website and calculation tools solely for your internal business analysis or educational evaluation. You agree that you will not:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Deploy automated scripts, bots, spiders, or scrapers to systematically extract calculator formulas, content blocks, or benchmark datasets for commercial aggregation without express written authorization.</li>
        <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or tamper with the underlying JavaScript execution environment or web security layers.</li>
        <li>Frame, mirror, or repackage CreatorCalcLab calculators as your own proprietary software inside third-party applications without attribution and licensing agreements.</li>
        <li>Use the website in any manner that impairs server availability, causes network degradation, or interferes with other users' lawful enjoyment of the platform.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
      <p>
        The design, layout, editorial guides, mathematical formulas, comparative matrices, code scripts, graphic logos, and compilation of calculators hosted on CreatorCalcLab are the intellectual property of CreatorCalcLab and are protected under United States and international copyright, trademark, and unfair competition laws. Third-party brand names, company trademarks, and platform logos (e.g., Shopify, Etsy, YouTube, Stripe) are the property of their respective owners and are referenced solely for descriptive, comparative, and nominative fair use purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED UNDER APPLICABLE LAW, CREATORCALCLAB IS PROVIDED ON AN "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, WHETHER EXPRESS, IMPLIED, STATUTORY, OR OTHERWISE. WE EXPRESSLY DISCLAIM ALL WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, TITLE, ACCURACY, COMPLETENESS, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT CALCULATIONS WILL BE ERROR-FREE, UNINTERRUPTED, OR FREE OF CODING BUGS, OR THAT OUR DATA WILL PRECISELY REFLECT EVERY PLATFORM INVOICE.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHALL CREATORCALCLAB, ITS FOUNDERS, OFFICERS, DIRECTORS, RESEARCHERS, EMPLOYEES, OR AGENTS BE LIABLE TO YOU OR ANY THIRD PARTY FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, SPECIAL, PUNITIVE, OR EXEMPLARY DAMAGES—INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO LOSS OF PROFITS, LOSS OF REVENUE, LOSS OF BUSINESS OPPORTUNITY, TAX PENALTIES, OVERCHARGED GATEWAY FEES, OR LOSS OF DATA—ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH YOUR USE OF OR INABILITY TO USE OUR CALCULATORS, REGARDLESS OF WHETHER WE WERE ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES. IN ALL CIRCUMSTANCES, OUR TOTAL AGGREGATE LIABILITY SHALL NOT EXCEED ONE HUNDRED UNITED STATES DOLLARS ($100.00 USD).
      </p>

      <h2>8. Indemnification</h2>
      <p>
        You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless CreatorCalcLab and its affiliates from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, judgments, awards, losses, costs, expenses, or fees (including reasonable attorneys' fees) resulting from your violation of these Terms, your reliance on calculator outputs, or your business decisions made in connection with our website.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Governing Law & Dispute Resolution</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms and any dispute arising from your use of CreatorCalcLab shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Delaware, United States, without regard to conflict of law principles. Any legal suit, action, or proceeding arising out of or related to these Terms shall be instituted exclusively in the federal or state courts located in the State of Delaware, and you hereby consent to the personal jurisdiction of such courts.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Severability & Entire Agreement</h2>
      <p>
        If any provision of these Terms is deemed unlawful, void, or unenforceable by a court of competent jurisdiction, that provision shall be severed without affecting the validity and enforceability of any remaining provisions. These Terms and our Privacy Policy constitute the entire understanding between you and CreatorCalcLab regarding your use of the website.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Inquiries & Legal Notices</h2>
      <p>
        For inquiries regarding these Terms or to report suspected intellectual property infringement, please contact our legal desk:
      </p>
      <div class="bg-slate-100 p-4 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-800 font-mono mt-4">
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1 font-sans">CreatorCalcLab Legal & Compliance Department</p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:compliance@creatorcalclab.com" class="text-emerald-700 underline">compliance@creatorcalclab.com</a></p>
        <p>Website: <a href="https://creatorcalclab.com" class="text-emerald-700 underline">https://creatorcalclab.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
